ef aldığı sivillerin hikayesi yürek burktu\",\"description\":\"Diyarbakır'da polislere çorba içtikleri sırada PKK'lı teröristlerce düzenlenen silahlı saldırı sonucu hayatını kaybeden iki sivilin yaşam hikayeleri yürek burktu.\",\"routeLink\":\"turkiye/terorun-hedef-aldigi-sivillerin-hikayesi-yurek-burktu/11621\",\"imageUrl\":\"447376e8f3c39f0b02305bcec2cfd3da.jpg\",\"archive\":false,\"videoUrl\":null,\"videoTime\":null,\"author\":null,\"authorImageUrl\":\"\",\"authorId\":null,\"authorTitle\":null,\"authorUrl\":\"\",\"poster\":null,\"filePath\":\"Contents/2015/09/12\",\"headline\":null,\"slot\":null,\"showAtLastNews\":1,\"createDate\":\"2015-09-12T19:17:48\",\"publishDate\":null,\"contentPhotos\":[],\"contentVideos\":[],\"id\":11621,\"imagePath\":\"https://web-cdnprod.aa.com.tr/uploads/Contents/2015/09/12/\",\"videoPath\":\"\",\"posterPath\":\"\",\"posterUrl\":\"\",\"formatedCreatedDate\":\"12 Eylül 2015\",\"formatedUpdatedDate\":\"\",\"fullRoute\":\"/tr/turkiye/terorun-hedef-aldigi-sivillerin-hikayesi-yurek-burktu/11621\",\"timeDifference\":\"\",\"isRecent\":false,\"newsType\":1},{\"enmNewsType\":0,\"liveBlogId\":null,\"liveBlogIsActive\":null,\"contentId\":11771,\"redirect\":null,\"title\":\"Terör Diyarbakır turizmini baltaladı\",\"subTitle\":\"Terör Diyarbakır turizmini baltaladı\",\"description\":\"Çözüm Süreci'nde sağlanan huzur ortamında turistlerin yoğun ilgi gösterdiği Diyarbakır'da son günlerde artan terör olayları turizme büyük zarar verdi.\",\"routeLink\":\"turkiye/teror-diyarbakir-turizmini-baltaladi/11771\",\"imageUrl\":\"a2ffe66b5718165f08c8665272551fa0.jpg\",\"archive\":false,\"videoUrl\":null,\"videoTime\":null,\"author\":null,\"authorImageUrl\":\"\",\"authorId\":null,\"authorTitle\":null,\"authorUrl\":\"\",\"poster\":null,\"filePath\":\"Contents/2015/09/12\",\"headline\":null,\"slot\":null,\"showAtLastNews\":1,\"createDate\":\"2015-09-12T11:23:27\",\"publishDate\":null,\"contentPhotos\":[],\"contentVideos\":[],\"id\":11771,\"imagePath\":\"https://web